# helix on a Rust file of a small cargo project with errors, so
# rust-analyzer's diagnostics show: wait for it to start, save (cargo
# check runs), wait for the diagnostics, then move, search, select, split,
# quit.
!start 2000
!quiet 8000
!wait
!quiet 10000
:w\r
!quiet 500
j
